powers of the generator</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\overline{X^n} = (-1)^n \\cdot X^n</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/polynomial-bar-involution-table-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-polynomial-bar-involution-table-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":41,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":57}}}
